  "body": "CCC Issued - Ready for Settlement!\r\n\r\nA rare combination of generous proportions, architectural elegance and natural surroundings, this beautifully designed residence occupies an impressive 918m² freehold corner site in the heart of Long Bay.\r\n\r\nEnjoying a peaceful outlook over its own expansive green landscape, the property offers a wonderful sense of space and privacy. Its desirable corner position allows for abundant natural light, a more open aspect and enhanced separation from neighbouring homes.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 332m² of enclosed floor area, this substantial family residence has been thoughtfully designed to combine contemporary luxury with everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nGrand Design & Exceptional Living\r\nStep inside and be welcomed by the impressive high-stud living area, where soaring ceilings and expansive floor-to-ceiling windows create an immediate sense of grandeur.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully appointed designer kitchen features quality appliances, double ovens and a separate butler's pantry, making it ideal for both everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow connects the main living spaces to a timber deck, an inviting place to relax, entertain or simply enjoy the tranquil green outlook.\r\n\r\nBeyond the deck, the property's extensive natural green landscape provides an attractive, low-key backdrop, offering a refreshing sense of openness without the expectations of maintaining a large traditional lawn.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• 918m² Freehold Corner Site - A substantial landholding with excellent privacy and natural light\r\n• Approx. 332m² Enclosed Floor Area - Generous space for comfortable family living\r\n• 4 Spacious Bedrooms & 3 Bathrooms - Including two ensuite bedrooms\r\n• 2 Separate Living Areas - Flexible spaces for family relaxation and entertaining\r\n• Impressive High-Ceiling Living Room - Featuring expansive glazing and abundant natural light\r\n• Designer Kitchen & Butler's Pantry - Quality appliances, double ovens and excellent storage\r\n• Ground-Floor Ensuite Bedroom - Ideal for guests, extended family or multigenerational living\r\n• Timber Outdoor Deck - A welcoming entertaining space overlooking the greenery\r\n• Private Green Outlook - Extensive natural landscaping enhances the home's peaceful setting\r\n• Double Internal-Access Garage - Secure and convenient parking\r\n• Contemporary Construction - A stylish combination of brick veneer, timber and fibre-cement cladding\r\n\r\nThe Advantage of a Corner Position\r\nPositioned on a corner site, this home benefits from increased natural light, an enhanced sense of openness and greater privacy.\r\n\r\nCombined with the surrounding greenery, it creates a peaceful retreat where you can enjoy the beauty of nature without sacrificing the convenience of modern living.\r\n\r\nPrime Long Bay Location\r\nEnjoy the best of Long Bay living, with Long Bay Village, local cafés, shops, the beautiful beach and Long Bay Regional Park all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the sought-after school zones, including Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nMove In Without the Wait\r\nWith the Code Compliance Certificate (CCC) already issued, the property is ready for settlement.\r\nNo lengthy construction delays or uncertainty - simply secure your new home and plan your move.\r\nA substantial freehold corner property, impressive architectural design and a beautiful natural outlook - this is a home that delivers space, privacy and lifestyle in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
